es an initial design proposal (RFD 0001) for a remote worker service, along with a first draft of the gRPC API defined in worker.proto.\r\n\r\nThe goal of this design is to define a simple, secure job execution service with clear ownership semantics and a minimal but extensible API surface.\r\n\r\n## Design highlights\r\n- gRPC-based API for strongly typed contracts and clear client/server boundaries\r\n- Explicit job ownership model (caller becomes owner)\r\n- Simple lifecycle model (start → running → finished/failed)\r\n\r\n## Review focus\r\n- API shape and naming (RPC semantics)\r\n- Job ownership and access model\r\n- Lifecycle/state modeling\r\n- Any missing edge cases or incorrect assumptions\r\n\r\n## Out of scope (for this PR)\r\n- Implementation of the worker service\r\n- Advanced RBAC or multi-tenant isolation\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n- Verified `protoc --go_out=. --go-grpc_out=. worker.proto` successfully generates code","created_at":"2026-03-30T01:03:10Z","updated_at":"2026-04-01T22:12:32Z","closed_at":"2026-04-01T22:12:32Z","merged_at":"2026-04-01T22:12:32Z","merge_commit_sha":"d9b6a32952facc4628c82722970d8c70fbee9a5a","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarkDHarris/teleport-systems-challenge/pulls/1/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarkDHarris/teleport-systems-challenge/pulls/1/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarkDHarris/teleport-systems-challenge/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarkDHarris/teleport-systems-challenge/issues/1/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarkDHarris/teleport-systems-challenge/statuses/f7d2739d11f10cb8fa32f651bdf9b16498dd3598","head":{"label":"MarkDHarris:design","ref":"design","sha":"f7d2739d11f10cb8fa32f651bdf9b16498dd3598","user":{"login":"MarkDHarris","id":11096525,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDk2NTI1","avatar_u